        "sendTo": "={{ $json.superior_email }}",
        "subject": "=HOD Approval Required [{{ $json[\"Id\"] }}] - {{ $json[\"Employee Name\"] }}",
        "message": "=Dear {{ $json[\"Superior\"] }},<br><br>\n\nI am writing to request your approval for Puasa (fasting month) application submitted by your staff member.<br><br>\n\n<b>Applicant details</b><br>\n<ul>\n  <li><b>Employee Name:</b> {{ $json[\"Employee Name\"] }}</li>\n  <li><b>Superior:</b> {{ $json[\"Superior\"] }}</li>\n  <li><b>Position:</b> {{ $json[\"Position\"] }}</li>\n</ul>\n\n<b>Application details</b><br>\n<ul>\n  <li><b>Working hours:</b> {{ $json[\"Working Hours\"] }}</li>\n  <li><b>Replacement Hours (working through lunch time):</b> {{ $json[\"Replacement\"] }}</li>\n  <li><b>Reason / Notes from Employee:</b> {{ $json[\"Reason\"] }}</li>\n</ul>\n\n<b>Action required</b><br>\nPlease click one option below:<br><br>\n\n<a href=\"https://YOUR_N8N_DOMAIN/webhook/early-leave-decision?id={{ $json[\"Id\"] }}&action=APPROVE\"\n   style=\"display:inline-block;padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #333;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;\">\n  APPROVE\n</a>\n\n&nbsp;&nbsp;\n\n<a href=\"https://YOUR_N8N_DOMAIN/webhook/early-leave-decision?id={{ $json[\"Id\"] }}&action=REJECT\"\n   style=\"display:inline-block;padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #333;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;\">\n  REJECT\n</a>\n\n<br><br>\n\n<b>Deadline for response:</b> {{ $json.deadline_display || \"Please respond within 24 hours\" }}<br><br>\n\nIf you approve, HR/Admin will proceed with updating the roster/records accordingly.<br><br>\n\nThank you.<br><br>\n\nRegards,<br>\nHR Team",
